.TH SDL_GetNumProperties 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetNumProperties \- Get the current number of items in a group of properties.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_properties.h>
.PP
.BI "int SDL_GetNumProperties(SDL_PropertiesID props);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
For an invalid
.BR SDL_PropertiesID ,
this returns zero and does not set an error message\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I props
the properties to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of property items available\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

